      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "قَالَ: «وَلَا يَأْمُرُهُمْ بِشَيْءٍ إِلَّا وَهُوَ أَدْرَكَهُ مِنْهُ، وَلَا يَنْهَاهُمْ عَمَّا يَنْهَاهُمْ عَنْهُ إِلَّا وَهُوَ أَدْرَكَهُ مِنْهُ، وَلَا يَأْمُرُهُمْ بِشَيْءٍ إِلَّا وَهُوَ أَدْرَكَهُ مِنْهُ، وَلَا يَنْهَاهُمْ عَمَّا يَنْهَاهُمْ عَنْهُ إِلَّا وَهُوَ أَدْرَكَهُ مِنْهُ»",
      "translations": {
        "en": "He said: 'And he does not command them with anything except that he has attained it himself, nor does he forbid them from anything except that he has attained it himself, nor does he command them with anything except that he has attained it himself, nor does he forbid them from anything except that he has attained it himself.'"
